Here is the generated code to evaluate:

<!-- @FIGURE_UI_BEGIN -->
<div style="font:700 13px sans-serif;margin-bottom:2px">Vanishing point of a translating bird</div>
<div style="font-size:11px;line-height:1.4;color:#333">A bird flies at constant 3D velocity <b>V</b>. Green rays from the camera centre <b>O</b> project it onto the image plane, where its image crowds into the <b>vanishing point</b> (focus of expansion).</div>
<button id="btnPlay">▶ Fly at constant velocity V</button>
<label><span>Time <i>t</i> along path: <b id="tVal">1.20</b> s</span>
